Z||000005||Ronnie||04-08-2001||11:28 AM||||Hey fella's.My wife put this thread out ysterday.I had gone to Arkansas to pick up an 88 GT, and it broke a belt with me near Tupelo on my way back to Ga. I was able to pick up a new belt at an Autozone nearby the shop I stopped at , and the mechanic installed the new belt for me.He charged me 25 bucks for doing the work, which , I was tickled with. They could have took me for a ride!!! They were very nice and helpful. The wife thought I might get stranded there overnight!!! HE HE. Got back home last night around 12 midnight. Thanks anyway.<P>------------------<BR>Black '86GT 4spd ,leather int.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero2_1_3.jpg"> ||||reg||6
